<report>
<title>Fisher's exact test (expanded)</title>

<p><b>Input table:</b></p>
<table>
<tr><td>@tab_a1</td><td>@tab_b1</td></tr>
<tr><td>@tab_a2</td><td>@tab_b2</td></tr>
</table>

<p><b>Arranged table and totals:</b></p>
<table>
<tr><td>@tab3_a1</td><td>@tab3_b1</td><td><subtotal>@tab3_c1</subtotal></td></tr>
<tr><td>@tab3_a2</td><td>@tab3_b2</td><td><subtotal>@tab3_c2</subtotal></td></tr>
<tr><subtotal><td>@tab3_a3</td><td>@tab3_b3</td></subtotal><td><grandtotal>@tab3_c3</grandtotal></td></tr>
</table>

<p>Expectation of A = @exp_a</p>

<table>
<block name="header"><tr><td><pval>A</pval></td><td><pval>Lower Tail</pval></td><td><pval>Individual P</pval></td><td><pval>Upper Tail</pval></td></tr></block>
<block name="row"><tr><td><pval>@a</pval></td><td><pval>@lower</pval></td><td><pval>@ind_p</pval></td><td><pval>@upper</pval></td></tr></block>
</table>

<p><pval>One sided @tail_1 @{p_1:pval}   (doubled: @{p_1d:pval})</pval><br />
<pval>Two sided (by summation) @{p_2:pval}</pval></p>

<p><pval>One sided mid-@{mid_p:pval}</pval><br />
<pval>Two sided mid-@{mid_p_2:pval}</pval></p>
</report>
